# Live GenUI Ask Pi (Analytics surface). Copy to `.env` (gitignored) and fill in.
# Without these the Analytics Ask Pi still works — it falls back to the captured static fixtures.

# GenUI (C1) API key (server-side only; never exposed to the browser).
ASKPI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Defaults to the paid Sonnet C1 model; set this to a free model slug to stay on the free tier.
# ASKPI_MODEL=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live Campaigns Ask Pi (CopilotKit agent on the new-campaign builder).
# Entirely optional: without a key the agent chat falls back to an offline echo
# agent, and the default new-campaign experience (the deterministic build
# wizard) needs no key at all.

# Anthropic API key for the live agent chat (server-side only). Get one at
# https://console.anthropic.com (API Keys → Create Key). Starts with sk-ant-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Optional — overrides the default agent model.
# PI_AGENT_MODEL=claude-3-5-sonnet-latest
